# The published Health Affirmation, "Release and Recharge" (Wave I -
# Discovery, CD2-4) and elsewhere in the manual. @fixed for the same reason
# as the Gateway Affirmation: this is a formal statement whose wording is the
# point, not phrasing to vary.

@segment   health-affirmation
@title     The Health Affirmation
@levels    F10
@fixed
@duration  ~1m30s

say When you return to the conscious, physical, waking state, your body will be so equalized as to overcome all those things that might hinder or prevent it from being and giving its best mental, spiritual, and physical self.
pause 6
say The body physical will create within the system those properties necessary to cause the eliminations to be so increased as to bring the best normal physical condition for the body.
pause 6
say The mental will so give that impression to the system as to build the best moral, mental, and physical forces for your body.
pause 6
say The circulation will be so equalized as to remove strain from all centers of the nerve system, as to allow the organs of the system to assimilate and secrete properly those conditions necessary for normal conditions of your body.
pause 8
say The nerve supplies of the whole body will assume their normal forces. The vitality will be stored in them through the application of the physical being, as well as of the spiritual elements in the physical forces of the body.
pause 8
say Perfectly normal, perfectly balanced, and perfectly equalized will be the condition when you return to the physical waking state.
pause 8
